hifiberry-tidal-connect (2.0.5) stable; urgency=medium

  * Build the package on tag and attach it to the GitHub release. Pushing a
    tag builds on a native arm64 runner -- needed because dh_shlibdeps has to
    resolve libasound.so.2 against real arm64 libraries -- and uploads the
    .deb to the release, so it no longer has to be built and attached by
    hand. The build fails if the tag and this file disagree on the version,
    rather than publishing an asset under the wrong number.

 -- Pulpier <138523980+pulpier@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 09 Sep 2026 09:22:16 +0000

hifiberry-tidal-connect (2.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Start tdcn again after an upgrade. prerm stops it so the binary is not
    replaced underneath a running daemon, but dh_installsystemduser emits no
    matching restart -- for system units dh_installsystemd restarts after an
    upgrade, its user-unit counterpart does nothing -- so every upgrade left
    the player stopped and the Web UI showing it inactive, with nothing to
    say why. Only started when the unit is enabled, so a player switched off
    deliberately stays off.

 -- Pulpier <138523980+pulpier@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 09 Sep 2026 07:54:31 +0000

